{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"只描述当下对亲近可能的吸引、紧张与兴奋，没有补入前史、具体关系或外部事件。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"「身体已经先绷紧」将紧绷感具体写成他实际发生的身体反应，可能把听感中的紧张意象落实为人物经历；本段已确立的变化并未明确支持这一具体化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"描述兴奋转为谨慎期待的情绪递进；「屏息般」是比喻，没有断言他真的屏住呼吸，也没有新增具体场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"「递出心意」描述的是可能的表达，「还不知道对方是否愿意回应」直接对应本段新确立的变化，没有声称实际表白或补入具体人物关系。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"progress\": \"是\",\n  \"progress_why\": \"这是第一段，按要求直接判「是」；本段从最初的心动与兴奋推进到意识到对方回应尚不确定、需要确认对方意愿。 \",\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"四条形成了从产生亲近愿望、出现紧张、转为谨慎期待，到意识到需要确认对方回应的连贯过程，不看听感记录也能理解。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8db67bd1-8202-4de4-9eca-04a0b1b48516", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T230937993230Z", "elapsed_seconds": 70.516, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T23:10:48.513574+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "6fa8b41d87ac3057006a271c7cfc4fe8149af6900b7f125601de342ce7883187", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false